  "value": {
   "primary": "RogSi turbo-naus: a zero-mana commander plus Moxen, rituals and zero-mana artifacts make early mana, then Ad Nauseam, Necropotence, Necrodominance or a wheel reloads the hand. Protection (Defense Grid, Hexing Squelcher, Samut, Vexing Bauble) pushes through a compact win.",
