   "advances_plan": "Rograkh is a free creature on turn 0 that turns on Mox Amber, Springleaf Drum, Paradise Mantle, the free sacrifice tutors (Culling the Weak, Infernal Plunge, Diabolic Intent) and the commander-conditional free spells (Fierce Guardianship, Deflecting Swat, Deadly Rollick, Jeska's Will, Flare of Duplication).",
   "honest_note": "The pair is deliberately asymmetric (blueprint L11): Rograkh is a cost-free enabler, and Silas Renn is mostly color identity; the strongest games often never cast Silas (L14). None of the 7 Spellbook combos uses either commander; the wins are the generic cEDH Oracle and Breach lines. The commanders make those lines cheaper, not possible."
